Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Core Edition is included unmodified, as the git submodule at sailens/, and is
built into this edition through a Gradle composite build. Apache-2.0 permits
that inclusion in an AGPL-3.0 distribution; the Core Edition repository remains
Apache-2.0 and is unaffected by this edition's terms.

This repository's own code is the thin host application under app/: its
identity, the declaration that navigation assistance is required, and the
wiring that composes Core Edition's libraries.

This edition
------------
This edition adds YOLO26 model weights, which are AGPL-3.0-covered. The combined
work distributed from this repository is therefore licensed under AGPL-3.0 (see
LICENSE). Distributing a build from here carries AGPL-3.0 obligations, including
providing complete corresponding source for that build -- which includes the
exact Core Edition commit the sailens/ submodule pins.

Model weights carry their own licenses and training dataset terms, independent of
any code license. The bundled semantic segmentation model is trained on
Cityscapes, which is restricted to NON-COMMERCIAL use. See docs/yolo-models.md
for full provenance of both models.

Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by Ultralytics. "YOLO" is used
descriptively to identify the models this edition integrates.

